Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 05:01:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): contain check failures and normalize alias keys
 [daveey]

Contain unexpected cheap-check exceptions so independent release, probe and upkeep lanes still execute. Normalize configured keys with input slugging; lexical original-key order resolves collisions deterministically while built-in GitHub identities remain authoritative.

Proof: seven regression cases fail on original production sources; all 13 pass with the fix. All 24 importing-consumer/docs suites pass (475 tests). scripts/check --base origin/main: 20 checks pass. No concrete live exception trigger claimed.
